╭─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮ 
│  Search Mode Help                                                                               │ 
│─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────│ 
│                                                                                                 │ 
│  Navigation                   Actions                       General                             │ 
│  h          focus results     enter      open tree view     ctrl+space switch mode              │ 
│  l          focus details     y          copy issue ID      ?          toggle help              │ 
│  k/↑        move up           ctrl+s     save to view       ctrl+q     quit                     │ 
│  j/↓        move down         ctrl+t     toggle text/BQL                                        │ 
│  /          focus search                                                                        │ 
│  esc        exit to kanban                                                                      │ 
│                                                                                                 │ 
│                                                                                                 │ 
│  Search Modes                                                                                   │ 
│  Text Search (default): broad LIKE search                                                       │ 
│    fields: title, description, notes, labels,                                                   │ 
│            id, comments, design, acceptance                                                     │ 
│  BQL Search: advanced filters, syntax highlighting                                              │ 
│  Switch with Ctrl+T or click Text/BQL tabs                                                      │ 
│                                                                                                 │ 
│  BQL Fields                                                  BQL Operators                      │ 
│  status      open, in_progress, closed, blocked, deferred    =  !=       equality               │ 
│  type        bug, feature, task, epic, chore                 <  >        comparison             │ 
│  priority    p0, p1, p2, p3, p4                              ~  !~       contains               │ 
│  blocked     true, false                                     in          match any: in (a, b)   │ 
│  ready       true, false                                     and or      logical                │ 
│  pinned      true, false                                     expand      up, down, all          │ 
│  is_template true, false                                     depth       1-10 or * (unlimited)  │ 
│  label       string (~ for contains)                         not         negation               │ 
│  title       string (~ for contains)                                                            │ 
│  description string (use ~ for contains)                                                        │ 
│  design      string (use ~ for contains)                                                        │ 
│  notes       string (use ~ for contains)                                                        │ 
│  id          string                                                                             │ 
│  assignee    string                                                                             │ 
│  sender      string                                                                             │ 
│  created_by  string                                                                             │ 
│  agent_state idle, running, stuck, stopped                                                      │ 
│  role_type   polecat, crew, witness, etc.                                                       │ 
│  rig         string                                                                             │ 
│  mol_type    string                                                                             │ 
│  created     today, -7d                                                                         │ 
│  updated     today, -7d                                                                         │ 
│                                                                                                 │ 
│                                                                                                 │ 
│  Examples                                                                                       │ 
│  status = open and ready = true                                                                 │ 
│  type in (bug, task) and status != closed                                                       │ 
│  created >= -7d order by priority                                                               │ 
│  type = epic expand down                                                                        │ 
│                                                                                                 │ 
│                                                                                                 │ 
│  Press ? or Esc to close                                                                        │ 
╰─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯ 